WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.284 --> 00:00:05.456
Tap a piece in the palette to put it in the fraction set.

2
00:00:05.456 --> 00:00:09.043
Today’s task: which is bigger, 1/3 or 1/4?

3
00:00:09.043 --> 00:00:11.329
The set’s total adds up the pieces.

4
00:00:11.329 --> 00:00:16.648
Tap a piece to turn it around its circle.

5
00:00:16.648 --> 00:00:19.413
The 1/3 wedge reaches further. One third is bigger.

6
00:00:19.413 --> 00:00:24.663
Labels can show fractions, percents or decimals.

7
00:00:24.663 --> 00:00:31.086
Rings view puts every size in one circle to compare.

8
00:00:31.086 --> 00:00:37.801
Hold the set’s handle to lock, copy or delete it.

9
00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:45.576
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
